## Responsive Behavior
- **Mobile first** — always write mobile styles first, then scale up
- **Breakpoints:** sm (640px), md (768px), lg (1024px), xl (1280px)
- Most users are expected to be on mobile
- Touch targets minimum 44x44px
- Horizontal scroll rows use `overflow-x-auto` with `scrollbar-hide`
- Bottom sticky elements on mobile (e.g. Buy button on product detail)

