## Database Schema

### profiles
```sql
id uuid primary key
user_id uuid references auth.users
display_name text
username text unique
avatar_url text
is_private boolean default false
created_at timestamp
```

### categories
```sql
id uuid primary key
name text
slug text unique
description text
image_url text
is_featured boolean default false
is_active boolean default true
created_at timestamp
```

### products
```sql
id uuid primary key
category_id uuid references categories
name text
slug text
brand text
description text
image_url text
product_url text
affiliate_url text
status text default 'pending' -- pending | approved | rejected
submitted_by uuid references profiles
rejection_reason text
created_at timestamp
```

### votes
```sql
id uuid primary key
user_id uuid references auth.users
product_id uuid references products
vote_type text -- upvote | downvote
created_at timestamp
unique(user_id, product_id)
```

### reviews
```sql
id uuid primary key
user_id uuid references auth.users
product_id uuid references products
rating integer -- 1-5
title text
body text
pros text
cons text
owns_product boolean default false
helpful_count integer default 0
created_at timestamp
updated_at timestamp
```

### saved_lists
```sql
id uuid primary key
user_id uuid references auth.users
name text
description text
visibility text default 'private' -- private | public
created_at timestamp
```

### saved_list_items
```sql
id uuid primary key
list_id uuid references saved_lists
product_id uuid references products
added_at timestamp
```

### waitlist
```sql
id uuid primary key
email text unique
referral_code text unique
referred_by text
product_suggestions text
created_at timestamp
```

