## Auth Rules
- Anonymous users: can view everything — all products, categories, rankings, reviews, vote counts
- Logged in users: can vote, review, save, submit products
- Admin users: identified by a role field in profiles table (`role: 'admin'`)
- Voting prompts sign up modal for anonymous users — never hard redirect
- One vote per user per product enforced at database level (unique constraint)
- Product submissions require approval before going public

---

## Row Level Security Patterns
- Users can only edit their own profile, reviews, lists
- Votes are insert-only from the owning user
- Products with status 'pending' or 'rejected' are only visible to admin
- Admin role bypasses RLS for moderation actions

