## What NOT to Do
- Do not use any inline styles — Tailwind classes only
- Do not use `any` TypeScript type
- Do not fetch data client-side if it can be done server-side
- Do not hardcode colors outside of the design system above
- Do not add Clerk, Cloudinary, or any auth/storage service other than Supabase
- Do not create admin UI that is overly complex — keep it functional and simple
- Do not show pending or rejected products to non-admin users
- Do not allow voting without authentication
- Do not use `alert()` for any user feedback — use toast notifications
- Do not redirect on auth-required actions — use a modal instead

